  (text "WM8960 on I2S (GPIO18 BCLK, 19 LRCLK, 20 DIN, 21 DOUT) + I2C1 (0x1A).\nClass-D speaker outs -> 2 x 1 W 8 ohm speakers (JST-SH 2-pin).\nHeadphone out + mic in -> 3.5 mm TRRS jack with jack-detect to GPIO.\nOwn analog ground pour; keep away from Buck A/B inductors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.00 25.00 0)
